  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Tapper</defName>
    <label>tapper</label>
    <description>A flat plate on many feet: a rounded pale-blue disc one cell wide, the yellow fluid inside branching through it in lightning-tree veins that brighten and dim in a slow pulse. It eats electricity. A wild tapper walks to your batteries, sits on them and drains them; a bank of them empties a battery bank in a night. A tame one never drains: it stores charge while the aurora storms over the Deep and pours it into any battery it sits beside.</description>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.CreatureBehaviors.RM_HydrocarbonBloodExtension" />
    </modExtensions>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>2.2</MoveSpeed>
      <Wildness>0.5</Wildness>
      <MarketValue>180</MarketValue>
      <MeatAmount>0</MeatAmount>
      <LeatherAmount>0</LeatherAmount>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-60</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>30</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <FilthRate>0</FilthRate>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
