  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Pooler</defName>
    <label>pooler</label>
    <description>A creature that is a puddle: a rounded meniscus of pale, cold-blue liquid with a slowly turning yellow core the size of a coin. It pours itself around obstacles and is drawn to warmth the way everything else here is drawn to light. It drapes itself over the warmest thing it can find: a fire under it goes out flat with no smoke, a heater stops, and a warm body under it chills fast until it is pushed off. Fire cannot touch it. A tame pooler hunts only fires.</description>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="RimMandrake.CreatureBehaviors.RM_HydrocarbonBloodExtension" />
    </modExtensions>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>1.6</MoveSpeed>
      <Wildness>0.6</Wildness>
      <MarketValue>200</MarketValue>
      <MeatAmount>0</MeatAmount>
      <LeatherAmount>0</LeatherAmount>
